{"title":"Career roadmap · Aviation Logistics Executive","role":"Aviation Logistics Executive","summary":"An Aviation Logistics Executive coordinates the movement, handling, documentation and tracking of aviation-related cargo, equipment, supplies and materials. Depending on the employer, the role may involve air cargo operations, warehouse coordination, freight forwarding, customs documentation, shipment tracking, airline cargo systems and supply-chain management.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM (Bachelor of Business Administration / Management Studies)","Course":"BBA – Aviation Management"},"about":[{"label":"Core combination","text":"Aviation + logistics + documentation + operations + technology"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A BBA in Aviation Management provides a strong direct foundation, particularly when combined with logistics, cargo, customs, aviation safety and digital supply-chain skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Typical route"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA Aviation Management","Airport/Air Cargo Internship","Logistics/Cargo Operations Executive","Aviation Logistics Executive","Senior Logistics Executive","Cargo/Logistics Supervisor","Aviation Logistics Manager"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build aviation, air-cargo, logistics, warehouse, customs and analytics skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in cargo operations, freight forwarding, warehouse, customs or aviation supply chain"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Cargo Supervisor, Logistics Manager, Supply Chain Manager or Airport Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Move into senior aviation logistics, cargo-network planning, supply-chain leadership or aviation consulting"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","bl